{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18954","headline":"故相国燕国公于司空挽歌二首 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"故相国燕国公于司空挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雕弓封旧国，黑弰继前功。\n十年镇南雍，九命作司空。\n池台乐事尽，箫鼓葬仪雄。\n一代英豪气，晓散白杨风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}